  · exact (coef_LU_1 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_LZ_1 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_U_2 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_Z_2 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact Bd_zero _
  · exact Bd_zero _
  · exact (coef_LU_2 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_LZ_2 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_U_3 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact (coef_Z_3 hr hq hc).le (by norm_num)
  · exact Bd_zero _
